  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(1)/(8) -{{(1)/(5)}+(1 - 0.6)}\n\nConcept used:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/47485e25d1b30c57dc271863db8b99be0c8e209069b2596cc885911d898a8a78.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\nSimplify the given expression\n\n⇒ (1)/(8) - {(1)/(5) + (1 - 0.6)}​\n\n⇒ (1)/(8) - {(1)/(5) + 0.4}\n\n⇒ (1)/(8) - {(1)/(5) + (4)/(10)}\n\n⇒ (1)/(8) - {(1)/(5) + (2)/(5)}\n\n⇒ (1)/(8) - (3)/(5)\n\n⇒ (5 - 24) over40 = -19 over40\n\n**∴ The simplified value of the expression is -19 over40.**",
